WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.345
Today starts with yesterday. Every day does, from now on.

2
00:00:03.795 --> 00:00:06.374
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:06.874 --> 00:00:10.901
Point to each letter in the Bring back strip. Your child says its sound.

4
00:00:13.442 --> 00:00:19.392
If one is gone, that is normal. Tap it, say it together twice, and go on. Do not make it a test.

5
00:00:19.842 --> 00:00:22.185
Now the two new ones. Here is the first.

6
00:00:23.124 --> 00:00:26.269
As in tent. Tap your fingertips together, like a tent.

7
00:00:27.507 --> 00:00:28.359
And the second.

8
00:00:29.322 --> 00:00:31.702
As in pig. Touch your nose, like a pig.

9
00:00:32.964 --> 00:00:37.695
Both of these are quick sounds. You cannot hold them. Listen to how short they are.

10
00:00:39.795 --> 00:00:44.713
Keep them tiny. If you add a sound on the end, words will be hard to join later.

11
00:00:45.163 --> 00:00:49.461
Say the names of the six pictures in job two together. Then step away.

12
00:00:49.911 --> 00:00:55.001
At the end, your child says four sounds to you: the two new ones, and the two from yesterday.
